\/ww\/100\/2008\/images\/finalists\/ilike.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a> <a href=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/8301-13546_109-9913297-29.html\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft\" style=\"float: left;\" src=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/html\/ww\/100\/2008\/images\/finalists\/lastfm.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a> Deux excellents sites \u00ab\u00a0sociaux\u00a0\u00bb sur la musique, tr\u00e8s similaires. Comme je ne sais pas lequel est meilleur, j&rsquo;utilise (un peu) les deux.<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/8301-13546_109-9913291-29.html\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" src=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/html\/ww\/100\/2008\/images\/finalists\/finetune.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/> <\/a>(essay\u00e9, mais me rappelle plus&#8230;)<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/8301-13546_109-9913193-29.html\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/html\/ww\/100\/2008\/images\/finalists\/amazonmp3.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a> <a href=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/8301-13546_109-9913222-29.html\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/html\/ww\/100\/2008\/images\/finalists\/blogtalkr.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a> <a href=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/8301-13546_109-9913280-29.html\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/html\/ww\/100\/2008\/images\/finalists\/emusic.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a> <a href=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/8301-13546_109-9913308-29.html\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/html\/ww\/100\/2008\/images\/finalists\/live365.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a><\/li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"winnerBtm\">\n<div class=\"winnerBtm\"><a href=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/8301-13546_109-9913312-29.html\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"last\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" src=\"http:\/\/www.webware.com\/html\/ww\/100\/2008\/images\/finalists\/zunemark.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>La derni\u00e8re tentative de pillage intellectuel de Microsoft&#8230;<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Navigation:<\/h3>\